  <!-- 03 How it works -->
  <section class="section band-dark" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="how-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
        <div class="section-mark"><span class="numeral">03</span><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p></div>
        <h2 id="how-title">Five Steps from a Sentence to a Session.</h2>
      </div>
      <ol class="lp-steps" role="list">
        <li class="lp-step">
          <p class="lp-step__head"><span class="numeral">01</span> Describe it.</p>
          <p class="lp-step__body">“A dark pop track with 32 instruments, a clean structure, breaks and a big chorus.” Plain words are enough.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="lp-step">
          <p class="lp-step__head"><span class="numeral">02</span> CuTTI builds it.</p>
          <p class="lp-step__body">Your AI assistant writes the song plan, and CuTTI builds it in Logic Pro: tracks, built-in instruments, regions cut at every section, markers, tempo and key.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="lp-step">
          <p class="lp-step__head"><span class="numeral">03</span> Every step is checked.</p>
          <p class="lp-step__body">CuTTI reads Logic back after each step and reports what it verified. Nothing counts as done just because a command was sent.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="lp-step">
          <p class="lp-step__head"><span class="numeral">04</span> Mixed and mastered.</p>
          <p class="lp-step__body">CuTTI sets a static mix and masters the song with Logic’s own tools, ready for streaming.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="lp-step">
          <p class="lp-step__head"><span class="numeral">05</span> Yours to finish.</p>
          <p class="lp-step__body">Every track, region and note is editable. Ask for changes in plain words, such as “make the chorus bigger”, or undo them.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

